  "headline": "Eribulin mesylate is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; Corvale East has 17.6 days on hand and the top buying option is Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc. supplied from Kindos Pharmaceuticals Co., Ltd. (last inspection VAI 2024-07-19)",
  "headline_cites": ["D2", "D1", "D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's records show eribulin mesylate is not on the drug shortage list as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 84 vials of the 0.5 mg/mL, 2 mL presentation with a daily use of 4.8 vials, giving 17.6 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule‑ranked first option is to buy from Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc., which is also not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hikma's supply for this product comes from Kindos Pharmaceuticals Co., Ltd., whose most recent inspection was classified VAI on 2024-07-19.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The second ranked option is Apotex Corp., also not on the shortage list, but its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The third ranked option is BSP Pharmaceuticals SpA, likewise not on the shortage list, with no identifiable plant on its label.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    }
  ]
}
